<!--Post: 3103--><!--Time: 1104453033-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3103"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dorothy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dorothy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 30, 2004 - 4:30 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/10531840.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/10531840.htm</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3103-->
<!--Post: 3109--><!--Time: 1104460102-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3109"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Oliver<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Oliver<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 30, 2004 - 6:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->No kidding they need tips. Boy, do they need tips! Wow, is that discouraging.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3109-->
<!--Post: 3234--><!--Time: 1104645667-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3234"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 01, 2005 - 10:01 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Local KAKE TV also had a news story about Chief Williams&#39; year end news conference. Yes conference, not news briefing. Reporters were allowed to ask questions! He did say that people&#39;s tips were welcomed. That shuts up the people who were saying there are too many tips called in...blah blah blah...hindering the investigation. No way. Chief says make that call if you have a tip. <BR>-Deb <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.kake.com/news/headlines/1313181.html" target=_top>http://www.kake.com/news/headlines/1313181.html</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3234-->
<!--Post: 3412--><!--Time: 1104883940-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3412"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Michaeljames85<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Michaeljames85<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 04, 2005 - 4:12 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I can&#39;t wait until Wichita receives the $1,000,000 that Congress has approved to fund the investigation!  They&#39;ll probably just offer up the money as a reward to whoever turns in BTK.  Are you reading this BTK?  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3412-->
<!--Post: 3418--><!--Time: 1104884825-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3418"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jujuree<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jujuree<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 04, 2005 - 4:27 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->A hefty reward might be just what this case needs.  Many people have known BTK over the years in his &#34;mild mannered,&#34; everyday life.  Maybe some have suspected, but didn&#39;t want to get involved or were just afraid?  It might be a little easier for a person to get over those fears if calling in their tip could also pay off their mortgage. <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t know what&#39;s been offered up to this point, but apparently it hasn&#39;t been quite enough.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3418-->
<!--Post: 4532--><!--Time: 1106498467-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4532"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Crimone<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Crimone<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 23, 2005 - 8:41 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Why--They do not use them<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4532-->
<!--Post: 4541--><!--Time: 1106511325-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4541"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dpinva<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dpinva<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 23, 2005 - 12:15 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Crimone, <BR> <BR>Actually, yes they do. The entire December 1 episode began with a tip. They follow virtually every single tip they get. If you feel that you could offer something to the investigation, call them. If not, get off thier case. They have a hard enough job without every Monday morning quarterback on the net dissing them.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4541-->
<!--Post: 4568--><!--Time: 1106532650-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4568"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Crimone<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Crimone<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 23, 2005 - 6:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have submitted my info to them twice now---so as you put it, &#34;Get off my case!&#34;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4568-->
<!--Post: 4572--><!--Time: 1106533918-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4572"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Curious2<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Curious2<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 23, 2005 - 6:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Crimone - did you submit the same info  <BR>twice, or additional info the second time? <BR>Did they respond to you at all? Did any detectives call you or write back to you? <BR>I&#39;m just wondering about the process of receiving <BR>tips from the public. Thanks.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4572-->
<!--Post: 4631--><!--Time: 1106612408-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4631"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Crimone<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Crimone<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 24, 2005 - 4:20 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hello Curious, <BR>I submitted two sets of info to them at two different times reference the same person---I have not heard back from them and it has been awhile so it looks like they are not interested--I think they should be--but that is only my opinion. So that really makes me wonder if they are even looking at any tips. Thanks<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4631-->
